# Logo Directory

Place your custom logo file here as `logo.png`, `logo.jpg`, or `logo.svg`.

The logo will be automatically displayed in:
- Header (40x40px)
- Sidebar (56x56px)

Recommended specifications:
- Format: PNG, JPG, or SVG
- Size: Square aspect ratio (1:1)
- Resolution: At least 112x112px for crisp display
- Background: Transparent (for PNG/SVG) or matching your brand colors

If no logo is found, fallback icons will be displayed instead.